  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Ethiopians Fighting Against Child Exploitation</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">To combat exploitative child labor in Ethiopia with a focus in rural areas and the traditional weaving industry. The project will reintegrate children into formal or non-formal education systems and transition children of legal working age into vocational education and apprenticeship training.</narrative>
  </description>
